WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.662
This example shows an explicit schema in PySpark The
schema

00:00:05.688 --> 00:00:11.362
states the expected column names and data types It
is more verbose than inference but

00:00:11.388 --> 00:00:16.916
it is more transparent In data preparation being
explicit

00:00:16.942 --> 00:00:19.087
often prevents silent mistakes later
